## How realistic is it to do this without driving?

**Very realistic—provided you book the transportation in advance.** Hotel Mas Pastora explicitly arranges taxis and transfers through reception. Taxi Palafrugell 24 operates throughout Llafranc, Pals and the surrounding villages, offers flexible itineraries and winery tours, and accepts WhatsApp reservations at **+34 624 583 129**.[9] [10]

The geography is compact:

| Route | Approximate drive |
|---|---:|
| Hotel Mas Pastora → Mas Oller ([📍 Map](https://www.google.com/maps/search/Celler%20Mas%20Oller%2C%20Torrent%2C%20Girona%2C%20Spain)) | 16 min |
| Mas Oller → La Sala de l’Isaac ([📍 Map](https://www.google.com/maps/search/La%20Sala%20de%20l%27Isaac%2C%20Llofriu%2C%20Girona%2C%20Spain)) | 2 min |
| Mas Oller → Vicus/Pals ([📍 Map](https://www.google.com/maps/search/Vicus%2C%20Pals%2C%20Girona%2C%20Spain) · [📍 Map](https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pals%2C%20Girona%2C%20Spain)) | 4–7 min |
| Mas Oller → Peratallada ([📍 Map](https://www.google.com/maps/search/Peratallada%2C%20Girona%2C%20Spain)) | 12 min |

### Best transportation model by itinerary

| Approach | Feasibility | Best for | Trade-off |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Hotel-arranged half-day driver** | **Excellent** | Tuesday tour plus lunch plus spontaneous village exploring | Most seamless; likely the most expensive and requires a quote |
| **Three pre-booked taxi legs** | **Excellent** | Fixed schedule with a known restaurant and pickup time | Best value; you lose some spontaneity because each pickup should be scheduled |
| **Calling taxis on demand** | Possible but not recommended | Very simple winery-only outing | Unnecessary risk of waiting in small rural villages; arrange ahead instead |
| **Rental car** | Only if one person drinks no alcohol | Maximum flexibility | One person must abstain completely; otherwise it defeats the purpose |
| **Mopeds** | **Do not use for this outing** | None | They are motor vehicles, do not solve drinking-and-driving, are less forgiving on rural roads and make transporting wine purchases awkward |

Taxi Palafrugell 24 publicly lists **Palafrugell to Pals from €25** as a regional benchmark, but it does not publish a price for this precise multi-stop itinerary. Ask both Mas Pastora and the taxi company for an all-in quote, then compare a waiting driver against separate scheduled legs.[10]

### My practical recommendation

For **Tuesday**, ask Mas Pastora for a **half-day car with driver from 10:30–4:00**, including Mas Oller and Pals. The ability to leave lunch or the village when you feel ready is worth paying somewhat more.

For **Wednesday**, three scheduled taxi legs are sufficient: hotel to lunch, village to Mas Oller at 4:30, and Mas Oller to hotel at 6:00. A waiting chauffeur is unnecessary unless you want completely flexible village time.

