> Hello, we are staying with you September 7–11 and would like help arranging transportation for a Mas Oller winery visit. Could you please quote both (1) a private car with driver for a half-day and (2) separate pre-booked taxi legs? Our preferred plan is Hotel Mas Pastora → Mas Oller → lunch in Pals or Peratallada → Hotel Mas Pastora. Both of us will be tasting wine, so we do not want to drive. Thank you.

## Bottom line

If you want the **best winery experience**, book the **Tuesday 11:00 tour** and lunch afterward at **El Pedró**, **Can Nau** or **El Mas**. Restaurant closures do not make Tuesday unworkable; they only eliminate La Sala, Vicus at lunch and Candelaria.

If you want the **best combination of lunch, village exploration and a relaxed tasting**, book the **Wednesday 5:00 tasting**, with lunch first at **La Sala, Vicus or Candelaria**.

Do not rent mopeds for this afternoon. A pre-booked taxi plan is entirely feasible, while a half-day driver is the most luxurious and flexible solution.

